---
import ProjectLayout from '../../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import HeroImage from '../../../assets/writing/hero-hello-sprytna.png';
---

<ProjectLayout
	title="Sprytna Cards"
	tagline="A slightly smarter NFC business card."
	heroImage={HeroImage}
	liveUrl="https://sprytna.cards"
	liveLabel="Visit site"
	writingHref="/writing/hello-sprytna-cards/"
>
	<p>Tap or scan a card to view a profile and download a vCard. Each user can hold multiple cards and multiple profiles, switching which one is visible on a tap — handy for a conference badge one day and a personal profile the next.</p>
	<p>Built solo with Elixir/Phoenix/LiveView over about 3 months of nights and weekends.</p>
</ProjectLayout>
